  "description": "Erection of a single storey ground floor rear extension, internal reconfiguration, following demolition of existing rear outbuilding",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development would result in the provision of substandard and poor form of living conditions for future occupiers in terms lack of outlook, daylight and external amenity space, to the detriment of the long term health and well being of future occupiers of the development, contrary to London Plan (2021) Policy D6, LP2 and LP17 of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;﻿The application fails to provide adequate information to demonstrate how the proposed development would deliver measurable Biodiversity Net Gain (BNG) or be exempt from the requirements, contrary to the requirements set out in the Environment Act 2021. In the absence of this information, the Local Planning Authority cannot determine the impact on local biodiversity or ensure compliance with Policy LP47 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (LP33), and Paragraph 187 of the National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
